 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "bias: daily C2/C3 (C2-open ref) closure on D + same-direction 1h CISD inside D (scope range)",
   "EQ close: FIRST 1h close of session D+1 beyond EQ=(D high+D low)/2 against the bias, in a session that OPENED on the bias side of the EQ (a close through it)",
   "opposing structure: 1h CISD (series_open, 2/2, max_wait 3) opposite to the bias confirmed in session D+1 at/before the EQ-break bar; daily profile NOT modelled",
   "trade the ORIGINAL bias at the break close (next M1 open); target = session open (18:00 NY); stop = prior day D's extreme on the break side (PDH for bearish bias); exit 17:00 NY; skip if stop < 0.10 x D range or open not beyond price",
   "only EQ closes WITHOUT opposing structure"
  ],
